// arms. Blazon: Gules, a lion rampant Or armed and langued Azure; on a chief
// Or three maple leaves Gules. Crest: a maple leaf Gules on a torse Or and
// Gules. Mantling Gules doubled Or. All geometry is original; no attribution
// is owed. Colours are the constants below. The element ids (shield-clip,
// torse-clip, motto-path) assume one instance per page.
